{"strongs": "H3444", "word": "יְשׁוּעָה", "translit": "ye.shu.ah", "root": "ישח", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "salvation", "definition": "יְשׁוּעָה noun feminine salvation ; — ׳ יְשׁ Ps 119:155 + 18 t.; יְשׁוּעָ֫תָה Ps 3:3 ; Jonah 2:10 יְשֻׁעָ֫תָה Ps 80:3 construct יְשׁוּעַת Exod 14:13 + 4 t.; suffix יְשֻׁעָתִי Job 30:15 יְשׁוּעָתִי Ps 62:2 + 12 t., + 25 t. suffixes; plural יְשׁוּעוֺת 2Sam 22:51 + 6 t.; יְשׁוּעֹת 2Sam 42:12 + 3 t.; יְשֻׁעוֺת 2Sam 53:7 — 1. welfare, prosperity: כעב עברה ישׁעתי Job 30:15 as a cloud my prosperity passed away. 2. deliverance: והיתה לי לישׁועה and thou wilt be to me for deliverance 2Sam 10:11 = 1Chr 19:12 . 3. salvation by God, primarily from external evils, but often with added spiritual idea: Gen 49:18 (poem), Isa 33:2 ; Isa 52:7 ; Isa 52:10 ; Isa 59:11 ; Isa 60:18 ; Jonah 2:10 ; Ps 3:3 ; Ps 3:9 ; Ps 14:7 = Ps 53:7 ; Ps 22:2 ; Ps 35:3 ; Ps 62:2 ; Ps 69:30 ; Ps 70:5 ( = תשׁועה Ps 40:17 ), Ps 78:22 ; Ps 80:3 ; Ps 91:16 ; Ps 96:2 = 1Chr 16:23 , Ps 106:4 ; Ps 140:8 ; Job 13:16 with verbs of rejoicing בישׁועה 1Sam 2:1 ; Isa 25:9 ; Ps 9:15 ; Ps 13:6 ; Ps 35:9 יְשׁועָה יָשִׁית חוֺמוֺת Isa 26:1 salvation will he set as walls ; compare phrase ׳ אֱלֹהֵי ישׁ Ps 88:2 , ׳ אֵל ישׁ Isa 12:2 , ׳ צוּר ישׁ Deut 32:15 (song), Ps 89:27 , compare צוּרִי וְישׁוּעָתִי Ps 62:3 ; Ps 62:7 ׳ יוֺם ישׁ Isa 49:8 ׳ מַעַיְנֵי הישׁ Isa 12:3 wells of salvation ; plural יְשׁוּעוֺת (intensive), of ׳ יְשׁוּעוֺת פָּנַי ׃י Ps 42:6 the salvation of my face (person; פניו ᵑ0 error, פני ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ), v Ps 42:12 ; Ps 43:5 כּוֺס ישׁועות Ps 116:13 cup commemorating saving acts (of drink-offering); further Ps 119:123 ; Ps 119:155 ; Ps 119:166 ; Ps 119:174 || צְדָקָה Isa 51:6 ; Isa 51:8 ; Isa 56:1 ; Isa 62:1 ; Ps 98:2 ; Ps 98:3 יְשׁוּעָתִי עַדקְֿצֵה הָאָרֶץ Isa 49:6 my salvation unto the ends of the earth ; בְּכָלאגּוֺיִם יְשׁוּעָתֶ֑ךָ Ps 67:3 among all nations thy salvation. 4. victory: with עָשָׂה work victory 1Sam 14:45 ; Isa 26:18 : elsewhere of victories wrought by Yahweh for his people Exod 15:2 (song) Isa 12:2 ; Hab 3:8 ; Ps 20:6 ; Ps 21:2 ; Ps 21:6 ; Ps 44:5 ; Ps 68:20 ; Ps 118:14 ; Ps 118:15 ; Ps 118:21 phrases: פעל יְשׁוּעוֺת do victories Ps 74:12 חֹסֶן יְשׁוּעֹת Isa 33:6 store of victories ; מִגְדּוֺל יְשׁוּעוֺת 2Sam 22:51 Qr tower of victories ( Kt מַגְדִּיל and so || Ps 18:51 ); מָעוֺז יְשׁוּעוֺת Ps 28:8 stronghold of victories ; ׳ רְאוּ אֶתיְֿשׁוּעַת י Exod 14:13 ( J ) see the victory of Yahweh , 2Chr 20:17 כּוֺבַע יְשׁוּעָה Isa 59:17 helmet of victory ; יְפָאֵר עֲנָוִים בִּישׁוּעָה Ps 149:4 he will beautify the meek with victory. — compare the synonym תְּשׁוּעָה below", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3806')\">BDB3806</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3444')\">H3444</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3805')\">BDB3805</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3807')\">BDB3807</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>salvation</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:155\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"155\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"155\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,155)\">Ps 119:155</ref> + 18 t.; <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעָ֫תָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 3:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,3,3)\">Ps 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:10\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,10)\">Jonah 2:10</ref> <bdbheb>יְשֻׁעָ֫תָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 80:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"80\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"80\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,80,3)\">Ps 80:3</ref> construct <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 14:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,13)\">Exod 14:13</ref> + 4 t.; suffix <bdbheb>יְשֻׁעָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,15)\">Job 30:15</ref> <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 62:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,2)\">Ps 62:2</ref> + 12 t., + 25 t. suffixes; plural <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:51\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,51)\">2Sam 22:51</ref> + 6 t.; <bdbheb>יְשׁוּעֹת</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Sam 42:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,42,12)\">2Sam 42:12</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>יְשֻׁעוֺת</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Sam 53:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,53,7)\">2Sam 53:7</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>welfare, prosperity:</highlight> <bdbheb>כעב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עברה ישׁעתי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,15)\">Job 30:15</ref> <highlight>as a cloud my prosperity passed away.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>deliverance:</highlight> <bdbheb>והיתה לי לישׁועה</bdbheb> <highlight>and thou wilt be to me for deliverance</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,11)\">2Sam 10:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,12)\">1Chr 19:12</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>salvation</highlight> by God, primarily from external evils, but often with added spiritual idea: <ref ref=\"Gen 49:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,18)\">Gen 49:18</ref> (poem), <ref ref=\"Isa 33:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,2)\">Isa 33:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 52:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,7)\">Isa 52:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 52:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2